    dialoguesFinalDays: []
  quarantineExitLines:
  - A holding cell? Does it have a bed? I could use a nap.
  - "Sure. Lock me up. Add it to the list of things that don\u2019t matter."
  killExitLines:
  - "Hm. Didn\u2019t even need to think about it, did you."
  - "Finally\u2026 I can stop\u2026 waiting\u2026 in lines\u2026"
